Here's the full fresh_bot10.py strategy:

Assets: BTC, ETH, SOL only (XRP removed)
Entry

Buy YES or NO when price hits 82-84c
Only between minute 10-13 of each 15-min window
One trade per asset per window

Skip hours (MYT)

02:30 - 03:59 — sleep 15 min
21:00 - 22:59 — sleep 15 min
All other hours trade normally

Sell

Target 97c — sell instantly when hit
During or after window close — keeps monitoring

Cut Loss (normal trade)

Instantly cut if price drops to 50% of buy price
e.g. bought 83c → cut at 41.5c

Flip after cut loss

Buy opposite side immediately
Only if opposite is between 50-75c
Below 50c → skip
Above 75c → skip
Only flip once per window

Flip trade rules

No cut loss on flip trades
Sell at 97c if hit
Hold to resolution otherwise — can go to 0c, no action

Google Sheets

Sheet1 — live PnL
Sheet2 — orderbook (min 10-15 only, clears on redeploy)
